# Radar Autonomous Market Intelligence Agent — Poora Backend Analysis (Roman Urdu)

Yeh report aap ke project ke **pooray backend** ki tafseel hai. Har file ka maqsad, kyun banai gai, graph/subgraph kahaan hai, database structure, agents, tools, API — sab kuch. Frontend aur .env file ki values yahan nahi hain (aap ki request ke mutabiq).

---

## 1. Project kya hai (Ek Nazar Mein)

Yeh ek **autonomous market intelligence agent** hai. Matlab: aap ek "watchlist" item (topic) banate hain, aur yeh system khud:
1. Research questions banata hai (Planner)
2. Web search karke claims collect karta hai (Researcher)
3. Un claims ko verify karta hai ke wo sach hain ya nahi (Verifier)
4. Purani (duplicate) news ko filter karta hai (Dedup)
5. Ek briefing report likhta hai (Writer)
6. Aap ki approval ke baad email karta hai (Deliverer)

Yeh sab ek **LangGraph state machine** (flow diagram) ke through chalta hai. Aage har hissa samjhate hain.

