## 6. Tools (Helper Functions)

### `db.py` — Database ka sab kuch
- **Maqsad**: SQLite ke saare operations yahan hain
- Functions: `ensure_schema()`, `init_db()`, `add_watchlist_item()`, `list_watchlists()`, `create_run()`, `update_run_status()`, `log_finding()`, `list_findings()`, `log_briefing()`, `get_database_counts()`, `get_run_rows()`, `get_recent_briefings()`
- `TERMINAL_RUN_STATUSES` = approved, rejected, skipped_no_news, send_failed, failed
- `ensure_schema()` idempotent hai — bar bar chale to bhi tables ko ALTER karta hai (watchlist mein category, frequency, priority, description, icon columns add karta hai)

### `search.py` — Web Search
- **Maqsad**: Tavily API ka wrapper
- `search_web(query, max_results=5)` — tenacity se retry (3 attempts, exponential backoff 2-10s). Kabhi raise nahi karta — fail ho to `[]` return karta hai
- Return: `{title, url, snippet, content}`

### `reader.py` — Page Reader
- **Maqsad**: Kisi website ka content nikaalna
- `fetch_page(url)` — requests se page fetch, phir `trafilatura.extract()` se main content. Agar wo kaam na kare to BeautifulSoup (`stripped_strings`, 5000 chars cap)
- 100 chars se kam content = failure. Kabhi raise nahi karta, hamesha `{content, source_url, fetched_at, success}` return karta hai
- User-Agent: "Radar research bot"

### `vector_store.py` — Memory + Dedup (ChromaDB)
- **Maqsad**: Pehle se dekh hi chuke claims ko yaad rakhna taake duplicate news dobara na aaye
- ChromaDB persistent collection `radar_findings`, **cosine distance** (fix kiya gaya tha — pehle Chroma default squared-L2 use karta tha, is liye dedup galat chalta tha. notes.md Failure #3)
- `is_duplicate(claim, threshold=0.75)` — top-1 match se similarity = 1 - distance
- `filter_new_findings()` — sirf naye claims pass karta hai
- Document id: `f"{run_id}::{hash(claim)}"`, metadata: `{source_url, run_id}`

### `run_events.py` — Live Events
- **Maqsad**: Har run ke live events ko memory mein rakhta hai (step, status, timestamp, message)
- Thread-safe hai (`threading.Lock` ke saath), dashboard ko live progress dikhane ke liye

### `debug_embed.py` — Debugging Script
- **Maqsad**: Embeddings test karne ke liye standalone script (Chroma distance bug investigate karte waqt banaya tha). Vector dimensions, norm, cosine similarity print karta hai

### `email.py` — KHALI FILE
- Yahan kuch nahi hai. Email ka asli code `agents/deliverer.py` mein hai. Yeh file dead code hai — delete kar sakte hain

