## 11. Cross-Cutting Observations (Ek Nazar Mein)

1. **Do entry points**: `main.py` (CLI demo) aur `api.py` (live server). Dono same graph share karte hain
2. **Teen data stores**: `radar.sqlite` (app data), `checkpoints.sqlite` (graph state), `chroma/` (dedup memory)
3. **Khali files**: `tools/email.py`, saare `__init__.py`, root `Final_Report` (ab yeh bharega!) — inhe clean kar sakte hain
4. **No subgraphs**: Poore project mein sirf 1 LangGraph hai, koi nested graph nahi
5. **Human-in-the-loop design**: Automations ke bawajood, email bhejne se pehle insaan ki approval zaroori hai — yeh achha design hai (ghalat news forward hone se bachata hai)

